  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Guild of Harwich Artists</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-websitemanager post-6761 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tribe_events_cat-guild-of-harwich-artists cat_guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-6761\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/events/occurrence-6761-2024-04-01t09-00-00/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Board Meeting</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2024-03-26T16:12:40-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, March 26, 2024, 4:12 pm\">March 26, 2024</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild Board will meet on Monday, April 1, 9-11:00am at The 204 (2o4 Sisson Road) in conference area A-01.  B0ard meetings are open to Guild members.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4421 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-art-in-the-park category-bank-shows category-plein-air category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-news tag-art-and-community tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-cape-cod-artist tag-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-4421\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/summer-kicks-off-with-the-guild-of-harwich-artists/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Summer Kicks Off with the Guild of Harwich Artists</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-06-27T09:21:05-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, June 27, 2019, 9:21 am\">June 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists is celebrating our 40th year with numerous art shows, public events and member engagements. Membership in the 80-person Guild is now open to all residents and taxpayers in Barnstable County.  For more information and membership application, visit www.guildofharwichartists.org.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4022 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-carolyn-letvin tag-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-4022\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/carolyn-letvin-demonstrates-at-october-monthly-meeting/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"499\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a river with a purple sky.\" src=\"/media/archive/14f2f2c521d735ff019e5da4342e3eb0e671995c98611dfa06d8cb8a9f7624c9.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/carolyn-letvin-demonstrates-at-october-monthly-meeting/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Carolyn Letvin Demonstrates at October Monthly Meeting</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-10-11T15:43:46-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, October 11, 2018, 3:43 pm\">October 11, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Oil Monotypes, or How an Oil Painter Can Become a Printmaker Fast and Easy! This demonstration will cover the process of a basic printmaking process for oil painters. Using your current oil <a href=\"/news/carolyn-letvin-demonstrates-at-october-monthly-meeting/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3768 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-news tag-fee-e-demonstration tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-ma tag-monthly-meetings\" id=\"post-3768\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/may-monthly-meeting/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman standing in front of easels with paintings on them.\" src=\"/media/archive/5cd6846c51bb8cf0b7ffb6794f5839847ba370398c13fc1e1e12193bbcc427db.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/may-monthly-meeting/\" rel=\"bookmark\">May Monthly Meeting</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-07T00:54:21-04:00\" title=\"Monday, May 7, 2018, 12:54 am\">May 7, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Presentation by Angela Zoni Mault, Executive Director of Creative Arts Center in Chatham. This will be a critique of member paintings, bring a painting with you for a review. This <a href=\"/news/may-monthly-meeting/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3731 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-andrew-kusmin tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-paula-casey\" id=\"post-3731\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/casey-winner-of-kusmin-original-watercolor/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"495\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman holding up a watercolor painting of a house.\" src=\"/media/archive/ef20caa18896d028886364acee6f28544d8eb873ab31e0c92aa4391f57745615.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/casey-winner-of-kusmin-original-watercolor/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Casey Winner of Kusmin Original Watercolor</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-28T22:08:56-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 28, 2018, 10:08 pm\">April 28, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artists member, Paula Casey, was the winner of Andrew Kusmin’s Saturday raffle. Kusmin discussed his new book “Palette of Dreams” at the Guild’s April Monthly Meeting. “Palette <a href=\"/news/casey-winner-of-kusmin-original-watercolor/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3705 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-events category-news tag-artweek tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-robin-litwin\" id=\"post-3705\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"548\" height=\"410\" alt=\"©Robin Litwin, Bartletts on Turquoise\" src=\"/media/archive/f80ded191ea06dad5823e53a34595e7ffcc2468dfb0b265fcd12dea007e11e93.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Robin Litwin Demonstrates Encaustic Painting for ArtWeek</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-05T20:28:18-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, April 5, 2018, 8:28 pm\">April 5, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>New member of The Guild of Harwich Artists, Robin Litwin is a Harwich artist and photographer. In 2008, she retired from a 25-year career teaching in the Art Department at <a href=\"/news/robin-litwin-demonstrates-encaustic-painting-for-artweek/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>2</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<span class=\"page-numbers dots\">…</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>6</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<a class=\"next page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>Next →</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span></div>\n\t</nav>\n\n\t\n",
